  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2cf3496069245fb0",
      "translationZh": "介绍 Gemini 3.8 Live 和 3.8 Live Extended Thinking",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "939daf817e9c7e19",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.8 Live 和 Gemini 3.8 Live Extended Thinking 是我们目前最先进的实时对话模型。智能和并行推理的重大升级使它们在协作和使用语音执行复杂任务时更加直观。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2eb006abda5576c",
      "translationZh": "技术成员，代表 Gemini 音频团队",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "您的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9396d34c840bf012",
      "translationZh": "此内容由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 处于实验阶段。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e0bfa231ca2481f0",
      "translationZh": "我们正在推出 Gemini 3.8 Live 和 Gemini 3.8 Live Extended Thinking，以使语音交互更加自然、流畅和智能。这些模型能够在不打断对话的情况下处理复杂推理、实时视觉上下文和后台任务执行。您可以今天通过 Gemini API、Google Workspace 和 Gemini 应用开始使用这些功能。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b43a10482221e5d",
      "translationZh": "摘要由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 处于实验阶段。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e5bed38d8408242e",
      "translationZh": "查看《介绍 Gemini 3.8 Live 和 3.8 Live Extended Thinking》以获取更智能的语音 AI。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "37d0dbe30efcf529",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.8 Live 提供快速、流畅的对话，具备实时视觉和语言支持。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ce24b631952767c0",
      "translationZh": "使用 3.8 Live Extended Thinking 处理复杂任务，同时保持对话流畅。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "37acd17c51d5d6bc",
      "translationZh": "这些模型在后台工作，管理工具，而您继续聊天。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d5255da13bfea54f",
      "translationZh": "您可以在 Google Workspace、搜索和 Gemini 应用中尝试这些新功能。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb4c941c19c3737a",
      "translationZh": "Google 刚刚推出两款新的 AI 模型，使与设备的对话感觉更加自然。它们可以处理中断，在语言之间切换，甚至在工作时解释它们的思考过程。无论您是在解决复杂问题还是只是聊天，AI 现在感觉就像在真正倾听并与您一起思考。这是让 AI 感觉像真实对话伙伴的一大步。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f344ef9188695765",
      "translationZh": "探索其他样式：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf1dcdea5ec88618",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们推出两款新模型，带来近实时推理的进步，以更有效地支持语音代理，并使与 AI 的对话感觉更直观、更智能。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1ce5df00b331c39d",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.8 Live：专为规模和成本效益而构建，结合了对话智能、流畅对话和视觉基础。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0897c1b53597174d",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.8 Live Extended Thinking：专为高复杂度任务而构建，具备更高的智能和多步骤推理能力。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43f056e802157bfb",
      "translationZh": "对于开发者和企业，这些模型提供了构建可靠、生产就绪语音代理的基础。它们还能让您在 Gemini 应用、Google Workspace 和搜索中使用 Gemini 进行更流畅、协作的对话 —— 仅凭语音即可应对复杂任务。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ca8a76f34e443a87",
      "translationZh": "体验更流畅、智能的对话",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa8c6c67e56ea80f",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.8 Live Extended Thinking 提供企业级任务完成和智能，在 Artificial Analysis' Speech to Speech Quality Index（82.6）中获得总体排名第一，并在 τ -Voice 上的代理任务完成率达到 68.6%，在 Sierra’s τ -Voice-banking 基准上达到 35.1%。它还具备强大的推理能力，在 Big Bench Audio 上得分 97.7%，同时相比其他前沿模型保持具有竞争力的价格。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "99bea1c57829f759",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.8 Live 在用户中表现出高偏好，在 Speech Agent Arena 中获得第二名。除此之外，它仍然具有高性价比 —— 为开发者和企业提供了一款能够胜任且高效、适用于规模化的模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "06d7368ad5a8272c",
      "translationZh": "在 ServiceNow 的 EVA-Bench（评估语音代理的基准）上，我们的模型通过在复杂工作流中成功平衡准确性与对话质量，推动了帕累托前沿。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2e733a2dc9b9635",
      "translationZh": "注：此测试在 Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform 的 Live API 上运行。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fd8a5482af7feb66",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.8 Live 能够在近实时的情况下处理视觉输入，利用上下文丰富对话以提供更有帮助的响应。它能够自动检测并在对话过程中在 97 种支持的语言之间切换。它在后台执行工具和 API 调用，同时继续对话，使模型能够确认请求并保持聊天，而后台任务仍在完成。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
